                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Standing with @RepScholten and the amazing care providers at Catherine\u2019s Health Center, a community health center in West Michigan, to fight for Medicaid was truly profound. They provide high quality medical care to Michiganders, no matter their income, but they rely on Medicaid to make that happen. I won\u2019t stand down until my fellow Members of Congress agree to fund Medicaid.",
