                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Great to meet with some of MI11's greatest - veterans & members of the Michigan @AmericanLegion! We discussed protecting vets' benefits, increasing access to mental healthcare & fully funding the PACT Act. I'm grateful for their partnership in supporting vets & their families! https://t.co/51EifNN0nd",
