                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In @ScienceDems today, we had a hearing about returning to the moon, but that's going to be hard to do when the @HouseGOP cuts healthcare & education for the American kids who might be tomorrow\u2019s astronauts.\n\nHow does that make us more competitive? \n\nShort answer - it doesn't. https://t.co/kJbpDJnunb",
