                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I took to the House floor this morning to share what Michiganders are saying about the state of our union. They are afraid of tariffs raising prices, cuts to Medicaid & Social Security, lack of access to medical information, and skyrocketing costs. Watch the full speech here: https://t.co/w4p7iJYLiz",
