                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "A budget cutting $880 billion from Medicaid while adding $4.5 trillion to the national debt.\n\nThat\u2019s the state of the union.\n\nI won\u2019t clap for that.",
