                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 32,
                "retweet_count": 15,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Cuts to Medicaid would be devastating to patients, hospitals, and families across our great state. Proud to stand with our incredible @GovWhitmer at Corewell Health in Royal Oak to fight back against the Trump Administration\u2019s attacks on healthcare for working families to pad the pockets of billionaires.",
