                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Great to meet with the Michigan Hospital Association this morning!\u00a0\n\nThey\u2019re here because they\u2019re worried about the uncertainty facing Medicaid and want us to protect it for Michiganders. I\u2019m proud to stand shoulder to shoulder with them in this fight. https://t.co/pzSB0Ucr9E",
