                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump\u2019s One Big Beautiful Bill is one big and tragic loss for Michigan\u2019s kids. With nearly half of our children enrolled in Medicaid, increased obstacles that deny care to those who need it most, are unacceptable. I will continue to fight to make sure Michigan families are protected.",
