                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I can\u2019t shout this loud enough: Trump\u2019s big ugly bill is disastrous for Michigan. It cuts healthcare, raises costs, slashes jobs, and threatens manufacturing across our state. But my sleeves are rolled up, and I will do everything in my power to stop this legislation from moving forward.",
