                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Let\u2019s be real, today\u2019s vote wasn\u2019t about helping people. It was about helping the ultra-wealthy, no matter who gets hurt. By slashing Medicaid and SNAP, Senate Republicans just made life harder for families, seniors, and kids across our state. Thousands of Michiganders rely on these programs to stay healthy and put food on the table. Michigan - I see what\u2019s happening and I will not back down.",
