                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This is beyond outrageous. Allowing ICE to access Medicaid records is a blatant violation of privacy. More than 3 million Michiganders rely on Medicaid, and people shouldn\u2019t have to choose between getting the care they need or protecting their privacy. This has to stop.",
