                "text": "The damage from Trump\u2019s ACA sabotage is real and Michigan families are paying the price with health insurance premium hikes of up to 17%. No one should have to choose between their health and their bills. I\u2019ll keep fighting to lower costs, protect the ACA, and deliver the affordable care people deserve. Health care should be affordable. Period.",
